            "review_title": "Review at Tartine Saïgon - 25 Nguyen Dinh Chieu, Q1",
            "review_text": "Laura F\n14 contributions\n0\nLovely cafe\nApr 2025 • Family\nLovely cafe in district 1. Sells good food, coffee and cocktails. Lots of fresh juices too, we came here most days of our trip.\nWritten April 7, 2025\nOwner's R\nDear Laura - many thanks for your visit and for this nice review. \nKind regards, \nThe team of Tartine Saigon\n-—————— \nTartine Saïgon, artisan bakery-café-restaurants run by passionate sourdough bakers\n🍸🍻🍷Happy Hour every day 3-7pm\nWe are open 🕑 7am-10pm at all our locations: \n📍 Tartine Saïgon - 25 Nguyen Dinh Chieu, Q1 ❄️🍕\n📍 Tartine Saïgon - 215 Lý Tự Trọng, Q1 ❄️\n📍 Tartine Saïgon Thao Dien, Q2 ❄️🍕\n📍 Tartine Saïgon An Phu, Q2 \n📍 Tartine Saïgon Vista Verde, Q2 ❄️🍕\n📍 Tartine Saïgon - Bà Huyện Thanh Quan, Q3 ❄️🍕\n📍 Tartine Saïgon PMH Mỹ Khang, Phu My Hung, Q7 ❄️🍕\nRead more\nWritten August 17, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
