            "review_text": "Francois\n2 contributions\n0\nBakery and much much\nNov 2024 • Family\nVery good food, very fresh ingredients my kids love it every time we go there!\nThe place is also an excellent bakery… so all sandwiches are absolutely top!\nAnd the breakfast menu (available all day) is full of delicious options!\nCome alone in a nice working atmosphere! Come with friends or colleagues (Pizzas are excellent and pleasant to share). Come with kids for pasta or burgers… \nAnyway you won’t be disappointed!\nService is fast and very Friendly!\nRead more\nWritten November 2, 2024\nOwner's R\nThank you so much for the fantastic review, Fravan35! We are absolutely thrilled to read your kind words and to hear that we are a hit with the whole family. 🍳✨\n\nKnowing that your kids love visiting us every time and enjoy our pasta or burgers brings a massive smile to our team. As an artisan bakery, we take great pride in using very fresh ingredients, so hearing that our sandwiches are \"absolutely top\" and that you love our all-day breakfast menu means the world to our bakers and chefs! 🥖☕️\n\nWe are also delighted that you highlighted the versatility of our space—whether it's for a productive solo working session, sharing an excellent pizza with friends and colleagues, or a fun family meal. Our team always strives to provide fast and friendly service to make every visit special. 🍕🍔\n\nThank you for being such a wonderful guest, and we look forward to welcoming you, your kids, and your friends back to Tartine Saïgon very soon! 🥐✨\n\nKind regards,\nThe team of Tartine Saïgon\n\n——————\nTartine Saïgon, artisan bakery-café-restaurants run by passionate sourdough bakers\n🍸🍻🍷 Happy Hour every day 3-7pm (except celebrations & public holidays)\n30% ♻️ anti-waste discount every day | 🕑 7am-10pm\n📍 Tartine Saïgon - 25 Nguyen Dinh Chieu, Q1 ❄️🍕\n📍 Tartine Saïgon - 215 Lý Tự Trọng, Q1 ❄️\n📍 Tartine Saïgon Thao Dien, Q2 ❄️🍕\n📍 Tartine Saïgon (An Phu) Lumiere, Q2\n📍 Tartine Saïgon Vista Verde, Q2 ❄️🍕\n📍 Tartine Saïgon - Bà Huyện Thanh Quan, Q3 ❄️🍕\n📍 Tartine Saïgon PMH Mỹ Khang, Phu My Hung, Q7 ❄️🍕\nRead more\nWritten May 30, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
