            "review_text": "JP\nBergen op Zoom, The Netherlands8 contributions\n0\nBest lunch since a long time in Saigon\nNov 2023 • Family\nDelicious fresh bread. Top it with whatever you want. Friendly service with a smile.\nRecommended!!!! If you don't want Asian for a while.\nShow original\nWritten November 10, 2023\nOwner's R\nThanks a lot. Glad you liked it!\n\nKind regards, \nThe team of Tartine Saigon\nTᴀʀᴛɪɴᴇ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ, sᴏᴜʀᴅᴏᴜɢʜ ʙᴀᴋᴇʀʏ-ᴄᴀғᴇ́-ʀᴇsᴛᴀᴜʀᴀɴᴛs ɪɴ sᴜɴɴʏ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ:\n📍Tartine Saïgon - 25 Nguyen Dinh Chieu, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon - 215 Ly Tu Trong, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon - Binh Thanh\n📍Tartine Saïgon - Thao Dien, Q2\n📍Tartine Saïgon - An Phu, Q2\n📍Tartine Saïgon - Vista Verde, Q2\n📍Tartine Saïgon - 14a Bà Huyện Thanh Quan, Q3 \n📍Tartine Saïgon - PMH Mỹ Khang, Q7\n⏰ 7am-10pm, every day for dine-in & takeaway, and baking twice a day\n🍺🍹🍷🥃Happy Hour Every Day 3-7pm #Buy1Get1Free\n🛒 You can also find our breads and goodies at our partner shops\nRead more\nWritten October 9, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
