            "review_text": "Hieu Pham\n2 contributions\n0\nD1 Restaurant\nJan 2023 • Couples\nTasty food. Beautiful arranged dishes. Modern, dining experience.\nPleasant ambience, waitress was sweet & friendly and the food was really good. \nĐồ ăn ngon, phục vụ thân thiện, không gian dễ chịu và thư giãn\nWritten January 20, 2023\nOwner's R\nVery kind of you. Thanks for your visit to our sourdough bakery-cafe-restaurant!\n\n______\nTᴀʀᴛɪɴᴇ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ, sᴏᴜʀᴅᴏᴜɢʜ ʙᴀᴋᴇʀʏ-ᴄᴀғᴇ́-ʀᴇsᴛᴀᴜʀᴀɴᴛs ɪɴ sᴜɴɴʏ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ:\n📍Tartine Saïgon 25 Nguyen Dinh Chieu, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon 215 Ly Tu Trong, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon Binh Thanh\n📍Tartine Saïgon Thao Dien\n📍Tartine Saïgon An Phu\n📍Tartine Saïgon Vista Verde\n📍Tartine Saïgon PMH Mỹ Khang \n⏰ 7am-10pm, every day for dine-in & takeaway, and baking twice a day\n🍺🍹🍷🥃Happy Hour Every Day 3-7pm #Buy1Get1Free\n🛵 Order for fast delivery or pick up\n__________\n🥐🍳🥐🍳🥐\nYou can also find our breads and goodies at our partner shops\nRead more\nWritten February 20, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
